# Stage Passports

Every stage must have one file in `docs/passports/`.

Before work:

- Record goal, scope, allowed paths, forbidden changes, and starting state.

After work:

- Record every created, modified, renamed, or deleted file.
- Record verification commands and results.
- Record limitations, manual actions, and user decisions.
- Set status to `ОЖИДАЕТ ПРИЁМКИ`.
- Stop and wait for explicit acceptance.

After acceptance:

- Set status to `ЗАВЕРШЁН — ЗАМОРОЖЕН`.
- Update `.cursor/rules/10-frozen-stages.mdc`.
- Sync the passport to the dedicated Google Docs folder.
- Record the Google Doc URL.
- Commit only if explicitly requested.

If Google synchronization is unavailable, keep the local passport authoritative, mark sync as blocked, and tell the user exactly which manual setup step is missing. Never skip the passport.
